| `renderBump(data, transitionYears)` | Chart.js line, Y-axis inverted rank 1–7, per-carrier color, annotation lines |
| `renderShare(data, transitionYears)` | Chart.js line, top-5 carriers by avg share, same annotations |

**`runMain` wiring** (lines 1011–1017): After successful primary query, extracts transition years, calls all four panel renderers, then fires `runBump` for the charts. The `finally` block bug (`showStatus.running`) is also fixed.
